This submission builds on, with thanks:

- elixir-raw-foovoo by @FooVoo (MIT, this repository): the HTTP server, request
  handling, JSON output, JWT and the SQL statements this submission started from.
- rust-tokio-Scooter1337 by @Scooter1337 (MIT, this repository): native/
  crypt-port.h, byteorder.h, bcrypt-batch.c and bcrypt-batch-impl.h, unchanged.
- crypt_blowfish by Solar Designer, via libxcrypt 4.4.36: native/crypt-bcrypt.c,
  unchanged, in the public domain (see the notice at the top of that file,
  which also grants a permissive license where public domain doesn't apply).
